<title>USA: TABLE - BMW July U.S. car sales flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BMW July U.S. car sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Motoren Werke AG</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     1,398	     1,477	     -5.3</p>
<p> Import Car		 9,371	     9,297	     +0.8</p>
